## Agent Instructions
1. Run `bd prime` for full project context
2. Run `bd ready --json` for available work
3. Claim: `bd update <id> --status in_progress --claim --json`
4. Work following .bmad/personas/ guidance loaded on-demand
5. Close: `bd close <id> --reason "summary" --json`
6. Sync: `bd sync` before ending session

